 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All 5 planned kinds kept (k48–k52). Flute archetypes are key systems (Boehm, Cooper, Brögger, Kingma) and maker house styles; no flute model lines for Muramatsu, Pearl or Yamaha because no retrieved page named them (Yamaha site returned 403). Piccolo has only one confirmed model (Haynes Amadeus). Recorder archetypes follow historical originals (Bressan, Denner, Rottenburgh) plus modern designs; Mollenhauer Denner/Canta, Küng Superio/Studio and Aulos/Yamaha model numbers left out (unconfirmed). Historical makers (Boehm, Cooper, Brögger, Kingma, Bressan, Denner, Rottenburgh, Morgan, Harlan) are archetype mk without brand entries; Zen-On and Rudall Carte appear only as version makers. Gemeinhardt, Jupiter, Sankyo, Altus, Louis Lot, Dolmetsch not added (no retrieved detail). No traditions."
}